Windows Disk Utilization Troubleshooting Lab
Scenario
Users are reporting that the server is running low on disk space.
Several applications have started generating warnings and the Operations Team has requested an investigation.
Objective
Identify the root cause of disk consumption and reduce disk utilization below 85%.
Environment
Server: windows1
Drive: C:
Access
RDP access has been provided.
Allowed Tools
•	File Explorer
•	PowerShell
•	Command Prompt
•	AWX Job Templates
Tasks
1.	Check disk utilization.
2.	Identify folders consuming the most space.
3.	Identify large files.
4.	Determine the root cause.
5.	Perform remediation.
6.	Validate recovery.
Success Criteria
The exercise will be considered successful when:
•	Disk utilization is below 85%
•	No system files are deleted
•	Server remains operational
Hints
You may find the following commands useful:
•	Get-PSDrive
•	Get-ChildItem
•	Get-CimInstance Win32_LogicalDisk

